requirements:
Closed local frozen manifest (not all fields need be sent):
- exampleId/sourceRef -> signalId, Book/manuscript/branch/mark/proposal-item/decision identities;
- revisionId, journalSequence, blockDigest, materialKey/materialDigest, reasonRevision;
- governing learning eligibility basis/decision, exact controls/scope/supervision snapshots and revisions;
- source record digest, original-to-redacted digest binding, redaction roster/version;
- ordered batch membership and encoded payload digest;
- current/excluded/deferred/superseded/withdrawn standing checked before send and again before proposal publication/use.

Initially excluded pending a typed contract:
- imported Word pairs (F-07 original/sample/event/membership contracts must land first);
- post-#1113 reason-ask signal kinds unless their exact material/source digest proves the same fields;
- review-finding-ignored before/after content not bound by the existing candidate digest;
- arbitrary rewrite history, whole documents, ambient neighbors, external examples or automatically inferred source associations.
These are functional limitations of the initial closed source set, not permission to claim the whole F-05 umbrella complete. A revised #1111 child must explicitly carry deferred signal types.
